WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.367
Kelli: I can't believe that snake ate a hamster!

2
00:00:07.368 --> 00:00:12.836
Theo: It's not just any hamster. It's Whiskers!

3
00:00:12.837 --> 00:00:14.625
Sarah: Bad snake!

4
00:00:14.626 --> 00:00:17.133
Riley: It's not Sammy's fault.

5
00:00:17.134 --> 00:00:23.565
He didn't know any better.

6
00:00:23.566 --> 00:00:26.091
Theo: It's my fault!

7
00:00:26.092 --> 00:00:28.915
I should have watched Whiskers better.

8
00:00:28.916 --> 00:00:34.349
Now he's gone forever! Sarah:

9
00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:37.692
He was so cute. Riley:

10
00:00:37.693 --> 00:00:41.820
I liked the way he nibbled cookies. Skyler:

11
00:00:41.821 --> 00:00:50.916
And the way he curled up in a ball and rolled. Theo:

12
00:00:50.917 --> 00:00:55.744
He used to curl up with me at night too. I

13
00:00:55.745 --> 00:00:58.248
miss him! Kelli:

14
00:00:58.249 --> 00:01:01.270
Maybe you can get a new hamster for Christmas. Theo:

15
00:01:01.271 --> 00:01:03.787
I don't want a new hamster.

16
00:01:03.788 --> 00:01:12.361
I want Whiskers.

17
00:01:12.362 --> 00:01:16.171
Snooks: Ar-ooo!

18
00:01:16.172 --> 00:01:20.280
Riley: Snooks feels bad too.

19
00:01:20.281 --> 00:01:34.436
Theo: Now Whiskers will never know how much I loved him.

20
00:01:34.437 --> 00:01:39.704
Riley: What is it, Snooks?

21
00:01:39.705 --> 00:01:43.233
Theo: Look, it's Whiskers!

22
00:01:43.234 --> 00:01:47.209
Skyler: Curled up beside Sammy!

23
00:01:47.210 --> 00:01:51.067
Riley: Sammy didn't eat Whiskers after all!

24
00:01:51.068 --> 00:01:56.551
Skyler: And now they're friends!

25
00:01:56.552 --> 00:02:00.303
Ben: Thank you, Sammy, for not eating Whiskers.

26
00:02:00.304 --> 00:02:05.338
Theo: Look, Whiskers wiggled his nose.

27
00:02:05.339 --> 00:02:09.013
Skyler: He's saying thank you to Sammy too.

28
00:02:09.014 --> 00:02:18.576
Riley: For being his best friend!

29
00:02:18.577 --> 00:02:23.290
Theo: Whiskers, you're the best hamster ever.

30
00:02:23.291 --> 00:02:32.942
Riley: And the Pet Lovers Club is the best club in the world!

